1
00:00:09,033 --> 00:00:11,133
<i> Ping, son.</i>

2
00:00:11,733 --> 00:00:15,267
<i>If you're watching this,
it means...</i>

3
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:16,500
<i> I'm dead.</i>

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,700
<i>And since you're watching
version one...</i>

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:25,067
<i> that means my heir is a woman,</i>

6
00:00:25,067 --> 00:00:27,233
<i>and you're about to get married.</i>

7
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:29,400
What if my heir turned out
to be a man?

8
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,533
<i>Then I'd have sent version two.</i>

9
00:00:31,533 --> 00:00:34,167
<i>I had a different plan for that.</i>

10
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:38,500
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

11
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,600
<i> Son...</i>

12
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,133
<i>I've watched you
your whole life.</i>

13
00:00:42,633 --> 00:00:45,400
<i>You've built an empire
on your own.</i>

14
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:47,400
<i> But you know,</i>

15
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:51,767
<i>it's much harder to build
a life with someone.</i>

16
00:00:53,533 --> 00:00:54,600
[SIGHS]

17
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,533
That's exactly why
I don't want to get married.

18
00:00:56,533 --> 00:01:00,467
<i>There's nothing wrong
with saying no.</i>

19
00:01:00,467 --> 00:01:03,633
<i>I'll give you a chance
to think it over.</i>

20
00:01:05,067 --> 00:01:06,500
<i> Pause this for now.</i>

21
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:09,000
<i>When you're ready,
play it again.</i>

22
00:01:09,567 --> 00:01:12,633
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

23
00:01:12,633 --> 00:01:13,733
[CLICKS]

24
00:01:14,367 --> 00:01:17,100
You know, Donato,
if you were still alive,

25
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:18,767
you'd turn a blind eye to Toto.

26
00:01:19,467 --> 00:01:21,367
I always let him take shortcuts.

27
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:24,167
That's why he never learns.

28
00:01:24,733 --> 00:01:26,567
I just want everything
you worked so hard for

29
00:01:26,567 --> 00:01:28,267
to be put to good use.

30
00:01:28,267 --> 00:01:29,500
As for June...

31
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:33,500
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

32
00:01:34,133 --> 00:01:35,267
I don't know.

33
00:01:35,267 --> 00:01:37,733
Even now, I'm still not sure
she's really your blood.

34
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:40,733
What if she's been fooling us?

35
00:01:40,767 --> 00:01:42,133
What if...

36
00:01:45,233 --> 00:01:46,733
What if she's fooling me?

37
00:01:49,233 --> 00:01:51,700
What then? Am I really
going to fall for it?

38
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:54,267
Are we really going
to fall for it? Am I?

39
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:57,733
Am I really going
to fall for it?

40
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,567
- [CLICKS]
<i> - So?</i>

41
00:02:01,567 --> 00:02:03,567
<i> You're still having doubts?</i>

42
00:02:03,567 --> 00:02:06,267
<i>You always told me
I was your idol.</i>

43
00:02:06,733 --> 00:02:10,667
<i>That you've never been
disappointed</i>

44
00:02:10,667 --> 00:02:12,333
<i> by any of my decisions.</i>

45
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:17,300
<i>So maybe you can
trust me one more time.</i>

46
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,567
<i> This isn't just for you.</i>

47
00:02:21,567 --> 00:02:23,533
<i>The world's a messy place, Ping.</i>

48
00:02:23,533 --> 00:02:24,900
<i> You know that.</i>

49
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:31,500
<i>And I want you to guide my heir
through whatever comes her way.</i>

50
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:35,733
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

51
00:02:35,733 --> 00:02:37,100
[MUSIC STOPS]

52
00:02:43,467 --> 00:02:49,167
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

53
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:51,600
Wow!

54
00:02:52,833 --> 00:02:54,300
Seriously?

55
00:02:55,367 --> 00:02:57,400
You really did all this for me?

56
00:02:58,367 --> 00:02:59,433
For you?

57
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:02,433
I can't just abandon
Donato's house.

58
00:03:03,833 --> 00:03:04,867
Okay.

59
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:08,167
June.

60
00:03:08,733 --> 00:03:10,400
- June!
- What?!

61
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:12,633
- Come here.
- [MOCKINGLY] Come here.

62
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:26,567
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

63
00:03:32,967 --> 00:03:34,333
Will you marry me?

64
00:03:34,767 --> 00:03:41,633
[ROMANTIC MUSIC CONTINUES]
